To create an agent with browser tools and PPT tools to search for CAMEL-AI info and generate slides, you can combine usage patterns from:
- examples/toolkits/browser_toolkit.py (for browsing and info extraction)
- examples/toolkits/pptx_toolkit.py (for slide generation)
- examples/agents/single_agent.py (for agent creation pattern)

Implementation classes to use:
- BrowserToolkit (camel/toolkits/browser_toolkit.py)
